  "problemStatement": "Find the eigenvalues of the linear system dx/dt = x + 2y, dy/dt = 2x + y.",
  "finalAnswer": "\\lambda_1 = 3, \\quad \\lambda_2 = -1 \\quad (\\text{Saddle point})",
  "steps": [
